# Living agent docs

When the user changes product rules, stack, or lasting conventions — update docs **in the same turn**.

| Kind | Where |
|------|--------|
| Product / game facts | `AGENTS.md` |
| How to edit code | `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` |
| Repeatable how-to | `.cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md` |

Don’t let chat be the only record. Don’t duplicate the same paragraph into AGENTS + every rule — link or one-liner + pointer. Skip docs for trivial one-offs.

Skill checklist: `.cursor/skills/sync-agent-docs/SKILL.md`
